      "breakdowns": [
        {
          "id": "db8b89ec-6dfe-4ee4-ba67-76e29f1c55cd",
          "bannerText": null,
          "comments": null,
          "created": "2026-10-09T12:56:34.360Z",
          "description": "Maya and Eli drive toward the lighthouse.",
          "elements": [
            "fa85ce27-aa47-45c0-b377-37dd4db86149",
            "fc3f85d2-d707-497a-8d23-bff8568cf349",
            "8d3b3ef3-36be-40e6-9d3f-0b7bcd2af08a",
            "78e1b988-1f31-4e36-933e-04f35dc34012",
            "f6afbd47-3457-4ac6-93b0-aabe4a79c5cd",
            "30e6e771-5ef4-4956-bb27-b6c63d1bd283",
            "87a40574-db53-4f87-9c26-059de34c119a"
          ],
          "pages": 0.375,
          "scene": "1",
          "scriptPage": "1",
          "duration": 3600000,
          "type": "scene",
          "_scriptText": "1 EXT. COASTAL ROAD - DAWN\n\nA battered station wagon follows the coast. The lighthouse is a pin of light in the mist.\n\nMAYA\nWe should have left yesterday.\n\nELI\nAnd missed all this?",
          "_needsReview": false,
          "_completed": false
        },
        {
          "id": "5ffe0da9-364a-4fa4-86d4-b0f11e0c6153",
          "bannerText": null,
          "comments": null,
          "created": "2026-10-09T12:56:34.360Z",
          "description": "An old map points to their destination.",
          "elements": [
            "77576c5a-88c3-4298-81bf-b5434babf6e3",
            "423812b0-d6cd-4c24-8cbc-0f55c7edc32c",
            "01c10ec9-0725-4ec8-af3a-33c4f3a06b6d",
            "78e1b988-1f31-4e36-933e-04f35dc34012",
            "f6afbd47-3457-4ac6-93b0-aabe4a79c5cd",
            "30e6e771-5ef4-4956-bb27-b6c63d1bd283",
            "d2661c86-6372-4fe3-a3b4-3bb3532cef57",
            "87a40574-db53-4f87-9c26-059de34c119a"
          ],
          "pages": 0.75,
          "scene": "2",
          "scriptPage": "1",
          "duration": 4500000,
          "type": "scene",
          "_scriptText": "2 INT. STATION WAGON - DAY\n\nMaya unfolds an old map. A red circle marks the lighthouse.\n\nMAYA\nThat's where he said he'd be.\n\nELI\nThen that's where we go.",
          "_needsReview": false,
          "_completed": false
        },
        {
          "id": "40eb7634-9402-489c-8567-92e8fc169af4",
          "bannerText": null,
          "comments": null,
          "created": "2026-10-09T12:56:34.360Z",
          "description": "Jonah greets Maya with her father's key.",
          "elements": [
            "c56646d4-1534-4cc2-b96c-157b7911bbea",
            "fc3f85d2-d707-497a-8d23-bff8568cf349",
            "01c10ec9-0725-4ec8-af3a-33c4f3a06b6d",
            "5a0d9ece-6e51-49ad-b08a-7770aeed404b",
            "78e1b988-1f31-4e36-933e-04f35dc34012",
            "efdb30ab-5ee2-42b0-976a-e6edb748755e",
            "4788bc24-62e0-4521-abea-03684e22a09e"
          ],
          "pages": 1.125,
          "scene": "3",
          "scriptPage": "1",
          "duration": 5400000,
          "type": "scene",
          "_scriptText": "3 EXT. LIGHTHOUSE - DAY\n\nThe car rolls to a stop. JONAH waits at the foot of the lighthouse, holding a brass key.\n\nJONAH\nI wasn't sure you'd come.\n\nMAYA\nNeither was I.",
          "_needsReview": false,
          "_completed": false
        },
        {
          "id": "eb1259f1-9004-4007-a3e9-6d80aed0b9dd",
          "bannerText": null,
          "comments": null,
          "created": "2026-10-09T12:56:34.360Z",
          "description": "Maya retraces her father's morning ritual.",
          "elements": [
            "e11c88a9-77f4-4b9a-be86-90377e621379",
            "423812b0-d6cd-4c24-8cbc-0f55c7edc32c",
            "01c10ec9-0725-4ec8-af3a-33c4f3a06b6d",
            "5a0d9ece-6e51-49ad-b08a-7770aeed404b",
            "78e1b988-1f31-4e36-933e-04f35dc34012",
            "efdb30ab-5ee2-42b0-976a-e6edb748755e"
          ],
          "pages": 0.5,
          "scene": "4",
          "scriptPage": "1",
          "duration": 2700000,
          "type": "scene",
          "_scriptText": "4 INT. LIGHTHOUSE STAIRWELL - DAY\n\nJonah leads Maya up a winding staircase. She runs a hand along the worn stone.\n\nJONAH\nOne hundred and twelve steps. Your father counted every morning.\n\nMAYA\nOf course he did.",
          "_needsReview": false,
          "_completed": false
        },
        {
          "id": "28695bb4-d44f-4f98-b320-09f6bc881f75",
          "bannerText": null,
          "comments": null,
          "created": "2026-10-09T12:56:34.360Z",
          "description": "Eli discovers a letter addressed to Maya.",
          "elements": [
            "372be587-50b2-40e3-bb57-e77cfa6e4924",
            "423812b0-d6cd-4c24-8cbc-0f55c7edc32c",
            "01c10ec9-0725-4ec8-af3a-33c4f3a06b6d",
            "f6afbd47-3457-4ac6-93b0-aabe4a79c5cd",
            "78e1b988-1f31-4e36-933e-04f35dc34012",
            "efdb30ab-5ee2-42b0-976a-e6edb748755e",
            "6e3ae60b-97ce-42ce-a86c-5de62238032f",
            "b9bd1fe4-e8ef-4d60-a320-b8f7428596a5"
          ],
          "pages": 1.25,
          "scene": "5",
          "scriptPage": "1",
          "duration": 5400000,
          "type": "scene",
          "_scriptText": "5 INT. LANTERN ROOM - DAY\n\nEli opens a wooden box. Inside: a letter, a photograph, and a compass.\n\nELI\nThis has your name on it.\n\nMAYA\nLet me see.",
          "_needsReview": false,
          "_completed": false
        },
        {
          "id": "83e24016-54cc-4b76-95e5-4d2b2cd26738",
          "bannerText": null,
          "comments": null,
          "created": "2026-10-09T12:56:34.360Z",
          "description": "Maya and Jonah talk as the tide comes in.",
          "elements": [
            "c56646d4-1534-4cc2-b96c-157b7911bbea",
            "fc3f85d2-d707-497a-8d23-bff8568cf349",
            "8cd623d3-e2b5-4f98-87d9-1add3b3113d2",
            "78e1b988-1f31-4e36-933e-04f35dc34012",
            "5a0d9ece-6e51-49ad-b08a-7770aeed404b",
            "efdb30ab-5ee2-42b0-976a-e6edb748755e"
          ],
          "pages": 0.875,
          "scene": "6",
          "scriptPage": "1",
          "duration": 3600000,
          "type": "scene",
          "_scriptText": "6 EXT. LIGHTHOUSE - DUSK\n\nMaya and Jonah sit on the seawall. The tide comes in below them.\n\nMAYA\nHow long do you think he waited?\n\nJONAH\nAs long as he needed to.",
          "_needsReview": false,
          "_completed": false
        },
        {
          "id": "ea5cb3d8-2837-4f42-bfed-eaee63d1f568",
          "bannerText": null,
          "comments": null,
          "created": "2026-10-09T12:56:34.360Z",
          "description": "Maya brings the lighthouse back to life.",
          "elements": [
            "372be587-50b2-40e3-bb57-e77cfa6e4924",
            "423812b0-d6cd-4c24-8cbc-0f55c7edc32c",
            "3b064ff5-8250-48e0-8577-2a8162727b00",
            "78e1b988-1f31-4e36-933e-04f35dc34012",
            "efdb30ab-5ee2-42b0-976a-e6edb748755e",
            "4788bc24-62e0-4521-abea-03684e22a09e"
          ],
          "pages": 0.625,
          "scene": "7",
          "scriptPage": "1",
          "duration": 4500000,
          "type": "scene",
          "_scriptText": "7 INT. LANTERN ROOM - NIGHT\n\nMaya turns the brass key. The old mechanism wakes with a low, steady hum.\n\nMAYA\nThere you are.",
          "_needsReview": false,
          "_completed": false
        },
        {
          "id": "28dc6355-aed7-46cd-a3a9-1fa758bcd72a",
          "bannerText": null,
          "comments": null,
          "created": "2026-10-09T12:56:34.360Z",
          "description": "Maya and Eli leave the coast behind.",
          "elements": [
            "fa85ce27-aa47-45c0-b377-37dd4db86149",
            "fc3f85d2-d707-497a-8d23-bff8568cf349",
            "3b064ff5-8250-48e0-8577-2a8162727b00",
            "f6afbd47-3457-4ac6-93b0-aabe4a79c5cd",
            "78e1b988-1f31-4e36-933e-04f35dc34012",
            "30e6e771-5ef4-4956-bb27-b6c63d1bd283",
            "87a40574-db53-4f87-9c26-059de34c119a"
          ],
          "pages": 0.375,
          "scene": "8",
          "scriptPage": "1",
          "duration": 2700000,
          "type": "scene",
          "_scriptText": "8 EXT. COASTAL ROAD - NIGHT\n\nEli closes the car door. They look back. The lighthouse sweeps across the water.\n\nELI\nReady?\n\nMAYA\nNow I am.",
          "_needsReview": false,
          "_completed": false
        }
      ],
